{"id":"a219a0d9757f10bd","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Localization Map","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map — ZFC Algebra2 Localization Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map — ZFC Algebra2 Localization Map","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-localization.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-localization-map — ZFC Algebra2 Localization Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc892e1ba0a8566f\" href=\"?note=bc892e1ba0a8566f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-localization.md\">../batch15/58-df-localization.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6db02e65bcb543bc\" href=\"?note=6db02e65bcb543bc\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md\">../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,\\ell\\in V\">\\(R,S,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,\\ell\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6db02e65bcb543bc\" href=\"?note=6db02e65bcb543bc\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md\">../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{-1}R\">\\(S^{-1}R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r/s\">\\(r/s\\)</span> 采用局部化商环记号（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bc892e1ba0a8566f\" href=\"?note=bc892e1ba0a8566f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-localization.md\">../batch15/58-df-localization.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2LocalizationMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2LocalizationMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}localization\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2LocalizationMap}_S(\\ell,R,S,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,R,S^{-1}R)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\left(\\ell(r)=\\frac r{1_R}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}localization\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2LocalizationMap}_S(\\ell,R,S,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,R,S^{-1}R)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\left(\\ell(r)=\\frac r{1_R}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>环运算、零元与单位元属于会改变局部化对象的结构参数，故纳入谓词签名；该映射是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\mapsto r/1_R\">\\(r\\mapsto r/1_R\\)</span> 的典范环同态。</li>\n<li>映射类型现在由知识库的集合编码函数谓词表达，而不是未注册的类型标注式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-localization.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc892e1ba0a8566f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-localization.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6db02e65bcb543bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5$（see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6db02e65bcb543bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S\\subseteq V^6$（see [[../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-localization.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc892e1ba0a8566f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S^{-1}R$ 与 $r/s$ 采用局部化商环记号（see [[../batch15/58-df-localization.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$（see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,S,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,\\ell\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"S^{-1}R","display":false},{"tex":"r/s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2LocalizationMap}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}localization\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2LocalizationMap}_S(\\ell,R,S,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,R,S^{-1}R)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\left(\\ell(r)=\\frac r{1_R}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"r\\mapsto r/1_R","display":false}],"bytes":1611,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1423","l